              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Diane"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a nice easy recipe to follow. But next time I will reduce the 1 teas. salt to 1/2 teas. and see if that helps. Otherwise it would have been great.",
            "datePublished": "2014-03-14T19:49:20.137Z"
