            "reviewBody": "This is a good, and more importantly, very easy recipe. It's not as good as classically prepared Spanish rice, but it's good to have a brown rice alternative. You can doctor it up any way you want - I add a little cheese at the end, bacon bits would be good, maybe some green onions. But, even simply as-is, this is a solid recipe.",
